{#-
  Confirm a new email address. Sent to the new address when somebody
  asks, on their account page, to move their account to it. The account
  keeps its old address until the link is followed. Context:
    confirm_url  the link that makes the change
    ttl_minutes  how long the link lasts
    name         who to greet: their full name, or their username where
                 the account has none
    username     the account's username, which they log in with
    email        the new address this is sent to, said back to them
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}Confirm your new Quill email address{% endblock subject %}
{% block preheader %}The link lasts {{ ttl_minutes }} minutes.{% endblock preheader %}
{% block body %}
{{ c.heading("Confirm your *new email address*") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Hi " ~ name ~ ",") }}
{{ c.paragraph("You asked to move your Quill account to this address. Your account keeps its old address until you confirm.") }}
{% call c.paragraph() %}Your username is <strong>{{ username }}</strong>. You will be asked to log in again once the change is made.{% endcall %}
{{ c.button("Confirm your new email", confirm_url) }}
{{ c.small("This link expires in " ~ ttl_minutes ~ " minutes.") }}
{{ c.small("This email was sent to " ~ email ~ ".") }}
{% endblock body %}
{% block reason %}You are receiving this because this address was entered as the new email for a Quill account.{% endblock reason %}

{% block text %}
Hi {{ name }},

You asked to move your Quill account to this address. Your account keeps its old address until you confirm.

Your username is {{ username }}. You will be asked to log in again once the change is made.

Confirm your new email: {{ confirm_url }}

This link expires in {{ ttl_minutes }} minutes.

This email was sent to {{ email }}.
{% endblock text %}
